ent-ClothingOuterModsuitMercenary = Gallóglach mercenary modsuit
  .desc = A heavy-duty combat modsuit with integrated defensive systems. Features advanced ballistic protection, reactive armor plating, and a toggleable energy barrier shield that projects a green outline around the wearer. Use in hand to activate the shield (drains battery). Part of the Gallóglach modsuit system.
  .suffix = modsuit

ent-ClothingHeadHelmetModsuitMercenary = Gallóglach mercenary modsuit helmet
  .desc = A reinforced combat helmet with integrated HUD, communications systems, and toggleable lighting. Features advanced threat detection and ballistic protection.
  .suffix = modsuit
